# ER Diagram Prompt — SafeSight-MLOps Thesis Project

> Copy everything below this line and paste it into Claude (or any AI) to generate your ER diagram.

---

## Prompt to give Claude

Please create a detailed, professional **Entity-Relationship (ER) diagram** for my thesis project called **SafeSight-MLOps**. This is a **multi-domain intelligent MLOps platform** comprising **4 sub-systems**, each with its own MongoDB database. All databases use **MongoDB (NoSQL document store)**, so relationships are represented via **reference fields (ObjectId refs or string IDs)** rather than foreign keys.

Draw the ER diagram using **Mermaid `erDiagram` syntax**. Group entities by sub-system using comments. Show all attributes with their data types, and mark primary keys (PK), foreign keys/references (FK), and required fields (NOT NULL equivalent). Show cardinality on every relationship line (||, |{, }|, etc.).

---

## Sub-System 1: SafeSight Web Dashboard (Port 5000)
**Database:** `safesight` (MongoDB)
**Purpose:** AI-powered fall detection & patient safety monitoring using YOLOv8 + pose estimation

### Collection: `securityusers`
| Field | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| _id | ObjectId | PK, auto |
| username | String | required, unique |
| password | String | required (bcrypt hashed) |
| displayName | String | default '' |
| organization | String | default 'My Organization' |
| tier | String | enum: core, pro, elite |
| role | String | enum: user, admin |
| email | String | |
